  "fullDescription": "🎧 Autumn Groove is an incredibly bold, chunky, and dynamic retro display font that perfectly captures the funky and cheerful energy of the 60s and 70s.\n\nIts distinctive, oversized letterforms and soft, playful curves demand attention, making it an excellent choice for loud, memorable headlines and branding.\n\nThis font’s unique selling point is its “groovy” aesthetic, delivering a vibrant, feel-good vibe ideal for projects that need a playful throwback touch.\n\nUse Autumn Groove to create stunning t-shirt designs, fun social media graphics, retro posters, bold magazine titles, energetic product packaging, or a chunky logo for a contemporary brand. It’s built for impact and adds an instant dose of nostalgic fun and high energy to any visual identity.\n\nThe font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.",
